      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Tôi không hiểu answers the traveler question \"I don't understand\" in moments when Vietnamese stops making sense. This is for when someone is speaking too quickly or using unfamiliar words. Lead with this before you ask for a repeat or a simpler version. Its job is asking for one clear help action before adding more words. Expect a slower repeat, a pointed explanation, or a switch to writing; then use Explore next if the reply creates another small task.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
