      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Start with Tôi không hiểu when \"I don't understand\" is the main thing you need understood. This is for when someone is speaking too quickly or using unfamiliar words. It gives the other person room to answer with a slower repeat, a pointed explanation, or a switch to writing. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
